      result: "After migration to AWS with Cloudflare CDN and a properly configured backup system: average load time dropped to 1.6 seconds, zero unplanned downtime in the 9 months following migration (vs. 14 incidents in the prior 9 months), and the platform handled a 4x traffic spike during a major exam period without any degradation. The business has grown 3x in users since without touching the infrastructure.",
