      result: "After implementing GitHub Actions CI/CD, Docker containerization, a proper staging environment, and Terraform-managed AWS infrastructure: deployment time dropped from 45 minutes manual to 8 minutes fully automated, production incidents caused by deployments dropped to zero in the following 9 months, any engineer on the team can now deploy independently, and a new developer can provision a full replica of production infrastructure in under 20 minutes from the Terraform modules.",
